# fixture: aca-household-of-three  (adversarial)
#
# the household-size override. A couple with a dependent on the plan is a
# household of three for the poverty line, which moves the applicable
# percentage and the cliff; filing status alone would make it two. Part-time
# wages keep income in the middle of the bands.

